{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Truck World: Australia - First Haul</strong> is your first mission as a truck driver in the heart of Australia. Hit the road through the continent\u2019s vast deserts \u2014 miles of road, scorching heat, and a face-to-face encounter with a real sandstorm await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/prologe_gif_1.gif?t=1746699148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conquer the Sandstorm</strong><br>Battle a roaring wall of dust that rocks your rig and cuts sight to almost nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/prologe_gif_2.gif?t=1746699148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Freedom Beyond the Cab</strong><br>Step out of your truck to manually secure the load, lower and raise the trailer legs, and connect or disconnect the hitch. Take full control over every stage of your delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/prologe_gif_3.gif?t=1746699148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outback Adventure</strong><br>Explore Australia\u2019s stunning red wilderness. Swap smooth highways for rugged dirt tracks and muddy backroads that can trap your wheels. Deliver vital cargo and help solve real-world challenges \u2014 not just for yourself, but for the entire Outback community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/prologe_gif_4.gif?t=1746699148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Next-Gen Physics and Visuals</strong><br>Feel every bump, every turn, and every blast of wind. Witness breathtaking sunrises and sunsets behind the wheel of a multi-ton truck, fully immersed in a new generation of trucking realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/prologe_gif_5.gif?t=1746699148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First Haul Is Just the Beginning</strong><br>We\u2019re actively developing and expanding the game \u2014 and your feedback plays a vital role. Share your thoughts \u2014 we\u2019re listening and building a better journey together!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694620?t=1746699148","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/f2071b06ec053e251575d764f70732f8f25bfae2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746699148","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/234ededd79e0d4acf0b19696c160007bc49ec6b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746699148","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/234ededd79e0d4acf0b19696c160007bc49ec6b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746699148","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Truck World: Australia - First Haul</strong> is your first mission as a truck driver in the heart of Australia. Hit the road through the continent\u2019s vast deserts \u2014 miles of road, scorching heat, and a face-to-face encounter with a real sandstorm await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/prologe_gif_1.gif?t=1746699148\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"